<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Specialty Care, Aetna started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Specialty Care, Aetna started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Joe France initiated coverage of Speciality Care Network Inc and Aetna Inc with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Specialty Care rose 1/4 to 8-5/8 and Aetna gained one to 85-3/4.</p>
